+Subject: [PATCH 5/7] Guest verifier tests: a complete contract pins fixture;
+ refusals must be for a chain reason; pin the legacy start
+
+The E2E's contract pins file lacked the four optional pins network/contract-pins.mjs requires present (zero when not
+deployed), so every decision was "unknown" for the consumer's own configuration: the cold-start and owner/admin cases
+timed out and the "refused as unknown" checks passed for the wrong reason. The fixture now has them, those checks also
+refuse an unknown that names the consumer's configuration, and a timeout names the last decision.
+
